description= 512x512 eyes in 12 colors for the vanilla bodies, with selectable eye shape, eye height, and lash length, picked from dropdowns on the character creation screen.
description= <BR>
description= Left and right eyes are separate art, drawn for both body fits. Eyes and lashes are separate layers, so the lashes draw over the eye color and changing one never replaces the other.
description= <BR>
description= Standalone: no framework required. Eyes wear, persist, and sync as ordinary clothing. Third-party eye packs can register entries and appear in the dropdown automatically.
description= <BR>
description= Optional patches included (active only if those mods are present): GridCharacterHub health model keeps your eyes, and ItIsOfInterestToMe ID photos and printed eye colors match them.
